      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dominating the foredeck is the freshly unlocked Hammer of Ages\u2014a
    colossal articulated arm of brass pistons and  scarred steel, its massive iron
    head hanging poised, humming with barely contained power.\nAcross the rolling
    expanse, on another drifting wooden platform, stands Captain Usopp, green cloak
    billowing. He laughs wildly, gesturing to his crew as if to make fun of the competition.
    You are not sure but it seems they be a crew of a darker colored flag.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b6c2f75775e5f694ea69207c4938fd95, type: 2}
