  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "James, your grease-streaked mechanic, climbs up beside your command hatch,
    eyes wide.\n\"Commander... the Hammer. We cracked those runes nights ago. Now
    it's here\u2014resonance perfect. One swing... hulls shatter like dry leaves.
    Feels too advanced for this place. Like we're not supposed to have it.\"\nHe
    glances at Usopp's distant figure.\n\"That braggart's full of surprises."
