      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Leading the field in this age is Senku, alpha of the Bonecrusher Clan.
    Our scan data shows him dominating valley raids with raw power: sharpened mammoth-tusk
    rams, thick hide shielding, and an instinctual charge pattern that has crushed
    anything in its path. 82% dominance in recorded engagements. He awaits you in
    the center ring.'
