      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This first rift opens on the dawn of human ingenuity: 10,000 BCE, a raw
    valley untouched by metal or fire. The committee has scanned the era's dominant
    forces and selected three proxies for your opening bracket. Each is a tribal
    champion enhanced with minimal TLC augmentation\u2014enough to make them worthy
    opponents, but true to their time."
