  m_text: "Your tank rumbles through the rift, treads grinding against the shifting
    timbers of a vast wooden deck that materializes beneath you\u2014ambience of
    the Age of Iron & Sail. Towering sails snap in the wind, a peaceful middle ages
    town nearby, distant cogs and galleons heel through the gray sea, but the battlefield
    is here:\n"
